<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 105,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 105,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's est 105,000, Wk ago 106,000, and Yr ago 96,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than mid-session Monday. Trade and offerings were moderate with good demand. Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			    Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
